repository's author. They are MAVLink message definitions from the MAVLink project
(https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink), copied byte for byte from the package of the Rust crate `mavlink`
version 0.21.0 (directory mavlink/message_definitions/v1.0/). Their SHA-256 values are in the README and
are checked by tests/same_wire.rs.

